Package: amaya
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: @RECOMMENDS@
Provides: gnome-www-browser, www-browser
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Description: privacy-first web browser built on the Gecko engine
 Amaya is a privacy-first browser built as a thin, auditable layer on
 Mozilla's Gecko engine. It ships without telemetry, studies or sponsored
 content, enables strict tracking protection, Total Cookie Protection and
 HTTPS-only mode by default, and bundles a content blocker.
